            "value" : "点击工具栏中的大脑图标（🧠）浏览 Anthropic GitHub 上发布的 MCP 插件目录。可按类别筛选插件，或按名称、描述、作者搜索。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click the clip icon to the left of the input field, or drag and drop files onto the input field. When dragging, the input field border highlights in the accent color to show the drop zone." : {
